one or more identified transmission / reception points, TRPs;
one or more identified positioning frequency layers; or
an identified combination thereof.

means for determining (802) a group of PRS resources;
means for determining (804), based on the group of PRS resources, a positioning reference signal, PRS, to random access channel, RACH, occasion, RO, mapping that maps PRS measurements to ROs during which a UE should transmit a RACH sequence; and
means for sending (806) the PRS to RO mapping to a base station that is serving the UE.
